      "evidence_text": "Sertraline is FDA-approved to treat six conditions in adults:\n- Major depressive disorder (MDD), the clinical term for depression.\n- Obsessive-compulsive disorder (OCD), where unwanted thoughts drive repeated behaviors.\n- Panic disorder, which causes sudden attacks of intense fear along with physical symptoms.\n- Posttraumatic stress disorder (PTSD), which can follow a frightening or traumatic event.\n- Social anxiety disorder (SAD), also called social phobia.\n- Premenstrual dysphoric disorder (PMDD), a severe form of premenstrual symptoms.\n",
